The local preview server stopped when it hit its two-hour limit, so http://127.0.0.1:8765/ no longer loads. I haven't restarted it: that was already the longest limit allowed, and nothing in progress needs it.

To open the prototype again, start a server from the prototype folder:

```
cd projects/travel-booking/prototype
python -m http.server 8765 --bind 127.0.0.1
```

Then go to http://127.0.0.1:8765/index.html, and add `?palette=cabin` to the address for Cabin dawn.
